abstract: >-
  "This repository holds digital assets associated with the article 'Styling \
  Microsoft Power BI dashboards with TeX'. That article describes how TeX may \
  be used in Power BI to style business intelligence dashboards. A gestational \
  diabetes dataset was used to demonstrate both desktop, and cloud-based, \
  TeX-styled dashboard rendering."
